hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"356","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Khashram, wa ghair wahid, qalu: Haddasana 'Isa bin Yunus, 'an Hisham bin 'Urwah, 'an abihi, 'an 'Aishah: ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam hadiya qubool farmate the aur uska badla dete the."
"357","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmud bin Ghailan, qala: Haddasana Abu Dawud, qala: Haddasana Shu'bah, 'an Qatadah, qala: Sami'tu 'Abdullah bin Abi 'Utbah, yuhaddithu 'an Abi Sa'id al-Khudri, qala: Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam apne khidr mein paheli hui kunwari kanya se zyada sharmile the, aur jab kisi cheez ko na-pasand farmate to hum unke chehre se pehchan lete."
"358","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmud bin Ghailan, qala: Haddasana Waki', qala: Haddasana Sufyan, 'an Mansur, 'an Musa bin 'Abdullah bin Yazid al-Khatmi, 'an mawlan li 'Aishah, qala: Qalat 'Aishah: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ki sharmgah ki taraf nazar nahi ki, ya unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ki sharmgah kabhi nahi dekhi."
"359","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Hujr, qala: Haddasana Isma'il bin Ja'far, 'an Humaid, qala: Anas bin Malik se hajjam ki kamaayi ke baare mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne hijama karwayi, Abu Taybah ne unki hijama ki, to unhon ne unhe do saa'in ta'am ka hukm diya, aur unke malikon se baat ki to unhone unke kharaj mein se kuch maaf kar diya, aur farmaya: Behtar tareeqa 'ilaaj jis se tum ilaaj karte ho woh hijama hai, ya tumhare behtar ilaaj mein se hijama hai."
"360","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Amr bin 'Ali, qala: Haddasana Abu Dawud, qala: Haddasana Warqa' bin 'Umar, 'an 'Abdil A'la, 'an Abi Jamilah, 'an 'Ali: ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne hijama karwayi aur mujhe hukm diya, to maine hajjam ko uski ujrat de di."
"361","[AI-translation] Ham ne riwayat ki Harun bin Ishaq al-Hamdani se, farmaya: ham ne riwayat ki Abda se, Sufyan al-Thawri se, Jabir se, al-Sha'bi se, Ibn Abbas se, farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne akhda'ain aur dono kandhon ke darmiyan hijamat karwayi, aur hajjam ko uski ujrat di, aur agar woh haram hota toh aap use na deta."
"362","[AI-translation] Ham ne riwayat ki Harun bin Ishaq se, farmaya: ham ne riwayat ki Abda se, Ibn Abi Layla se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek hajjam ko bulaya, usne hijamat ki, aur aap ne usse poocha: tumhara khiraj kya hai? Usne kaha: teen sa'a. Toh aap ne us mein se ek sa'a kamm kar diya aur uski ujrat de di."
"363","[AI-translation] Ham ne riwayat ki Abd al-Qudus bin Muhammad al-Attar al-Basri se, farmaya: ham ne riwayat ki Amr bin Asim se, farmaya: ham ne riwayat ki Hammam aur Jarir bin Hazim se, farmaya: ham ne riwayat ki Qatada se, Anas bin Malik se, farmaya: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam akhda'ain aur kihil mein hijamat karwate the, aur satrah, unnees aur ikkis ki tareekh ko hijamat karwate the."
"364","[AI-translation] Ham ne riwayat ki Ishaq bin Mansur se, farmaya: ham ne khabar di Abd al-Razzaq se, Ma'mar se, Qatada se, Anas bin Malik se: ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ihram ki halat mein Malal mein pairo ki pusht par hijamat karwayi."
